{'symbol': 'DG', 'date': '2020-08-27 09:30:00', 'title': 'Dollar General Corp Reports Q2 Earnings Per Share Of $3.12', 'text': "ORATION REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE $3.12.Q2 SAME STORE SALES ROSE 18.8 PERCENT.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $2.44 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q2 SALES $8.7 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $8.35 BILLION.INCREASES SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM AUTHORIZATION BY $2.0 BILLION.ANNOUNCES ACCELERATION OF KEY STRATEGIC INITIATIVES.DOLLAR GENERAL - BELIEVES CONSUMER BEHAVIOR DRIVEN BY COVID-19 HAD POSITIVE EFFECT ON NET SALES AND SAME-STORE SALES.ON AUGUST 25, CO'S BOARD DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.36 PER SHARE.AS OF JULY 31, 2020, TOTAL MERCHANDISE INVENTORIES, AT COST, WERE $4.4 BILLION COMPARED TO $4.4 BILLION AS OF AUGUST 2, 2019.NOT ISSUING UPDATED FISCAL 2020 SALES OR EPS GUIDANCE AT THIS TIME.FROM AUGUST 1, 2020 THROUGH AUGUST 25, 2020, SAME-STORE SALES INCREASED APPROXIMATELY 15%.SEES FY CAPITAL EXPENDITURES IN RANGE OF $1.0 BILLION TO $1.1 BILLION."}
{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2020-08-27 09:30:00', 'title': 'Dollar Tree Inc Reports Qtrly Earnings Per Share $1.10', 'text': 'DOLLAR TREE, INC. REPORTS RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2020.QTRLY ENTERPRISE SAME-STORE SALES INCREASED 7.2%.QTRLY  SAME-STORE SALES OF FAMILY DOLLAR UP 11.6%, DOLLAR TREE UP 3.1%.QTRLY CONSOLIDATED NET SALES INCREASED 9.4% TO $6.28 BILLION.QTRLY DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE INCREASED 44.7% TO $1.10.QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.10.NOT ISSUING UPDATED GUIDANCE AT THIS TIME.CAPEX FOR FISCAL 2020 ARE EXPECTED TO BE APPROXIMATELY $1.0 BILLION.ENDED QUARTER WITH $1.75 BILLION IN CASH ON ITS BALANCE SHEET.SEEING MATERIAL INCREASES IN AVERAGE TICKET, WHILE SEEING A DECLINE IN AVERAGE VISITS.QTRLY SAME-STORE SALES FOR FAMILY DOLLAR INCREASED 11.6%.SAW A NICE BOUNCE BACK IN HIGHER MARGIN DISCRETIONARY SIDE OF BUSINESS FOLLOWING EASTER.COVID-19 AND CIVIL UNREST-RELATED COSTS EXCEEDED $150 MILLION IN QUARTER.CONTINUES TO EXPECT COMPLETION OF 500 NEW STORE OPENINGS.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $0.92, REVENUE VIEW $6.22 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}
